00:07:33.348 --> 00:07:35.228
and is going ahead as a ballroom.

00:07:35.648 --> 00:07:37.308
And next to lawsuits, he says are aimed

00:07:37.308 --> 00:07:38.708
at weakening preservation law.

00:07:39.228 --> 00:07:42.088
The grounds already carry national historic landmark status.

00:07:42.628 --> 00:07:45.808
Trump cut back two national monuments in Utah in 2017,

00:07:46.228 --> 00:07:48.528
and the BBC says no court has yet tested

00:07:48.528 --> 00:07:50.768
whether a monument designation can be revoked.

00:07:51.008 --> 00:07:53.548
So it is unclear whether a successor or a lawsuit

00:07:53.548 --> 00:07:58.848
